  "img": "systems/vagabond-app/assets/class/barbarian_fps.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Barbarians are primal warriors that fight with the power of unbridled anger. The legends speak of their kills almost as their own unique deeds, using the barbarian’s name as a past-tense verb.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Iconic Barbarians</strong></b></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Brock Samson, The Venture Bros.</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Conan, Conan the Barbarian</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Guts, Berserk</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Logen Ninefingers, First Law Trilogy</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Playing Barbarian</strong></b></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">The barbarian is a mid-high-defense bruiser. Stick to an Enemy, and hit them very hard.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Action:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Attack (Melee)</span></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Move:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Frontline</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Training:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Melee, Survival</span></p>",
